{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064988/block/singleImage/3274060/df/01M7YW2RB5C6EQQK68E5XGWMT2.jpeg?updatedAt=1795258806\"/><figcaption>屯門友愛邨單位墮雜物，家人落樓執走男童被斥責。(Threads)</figcaption></figure><p>社交平台今日 (21 日 ) 流傳一段約 14 秒的 影片 ，當中可見多張紙張及其他雜物從友愛邨愛廉樓高處往下飄散。樓下幼稚園對開的行人路面亦散落多件物品，包括毛公仔、杯及衣夾等雜物。 據悉，家人發現後已落樓執走地面雜物，附近有兩名男童被斥責，懷疑該些雜物由兩童從家中擲出。</p><p>在 Threads 查看</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:44:01.592669+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:00:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T00:45:32.977860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:17.468096+00:00","content_hash":"ad4fc091cea3a8f1d5fab50abf9abbf2cb7e8c99fae0f52eeb9790b3cb039839","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}